// -- Language Context ----------------------------------------------------------
// +==========================================================================+
// |   CLAUDE PURIFY  -  Platform Security Engine                            |
// |   Authorized by Michael Lynn Jones II  -  LTI Ventures LLC             |
// |   LTI-2026-001  -  Active threat detection & response system           |
// |   Version: 1.0  -  May 27, 2026                                        |
