            <div style={{fontSize:"11px",color:"rgba(255,255,255,0.7)",lineHeight:"1.6",marginBottom:"8px"}}>Based on your scan profile: <strong style={{color:"#A78BFA"}}>4C Coily · High porosity · Oval face</strong></div>
