        finish:"Natural to minimal — light pomade or leave-in on damp hair. No wax.",
        culturalNote:"The side sweep with scissor taper is one of the most widely worn professional men's styles across the Arab world. It works with the natural density and growth pattern of Arab hair rather than against it. Arab clients booking in Western barbershops frequently report stylists attempting to thin or fade hair that should be kept dense — this reference documents the correct approach.",
